  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Game uses 6 Red balls and 6 Color balls.\n2. Scoring:\n   - Red = 1
    point\n   - Yellow = 2 points\n   - Green = 3 points\n   - Brown = 4 points\n  
    - Blue = 5 points\n   - Pink = 6 points\n   - Black = 7 points\n3. Play alternates
    between pocketing a Red, \nthen a Color.\n4. After all Reds are cleared, pocket
    Colors in \norder: Yellow \u2192 Green \u2192 Brown \u2192 Blue \n\u2192 Pink
    \u2192 Black.\n5. Foul:\n   - Foul occurs only when the \n      striker is pocketed.\n  
    - All other traditional fouls \n      are removed in this version.\n6. Highest
    score at the end wins.\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 5302535af1044152a457ed104f1f4b91, type: 2}
