      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Game uses Stripes, Solids, and one Eight-Ball disc or one 5-Ball Disc.\n\n2.
    The first coin you pocket decides your group:\n   - Pocket a Stripe \u2192 You
    play Stripes\n   - Pocket a Solid  \u2192 You play Solids\n\n3. Pocketing the
    Eight-Ball/Five-Ball before clearing your group results in an instant loss.\n\n4.
    Pocket the Eight-Ball/Five Ball after clearing all your discs to win.\n\n5. Foul:\n  
    - Foul occurs only when the striker is pocketed.\n   - All other traditional
    fouls are removed in this version.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
